  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Tutorial


    1.Each brawlers has 3 abilities: Attack, CD Skill, Charged
    Skill

    2.Attack will cost you ammo which is limited for each brawlers and
    will auto recharge after a few seconds

    3.CD Skill have a cooldown and you
    can use it after end cooldown

    4.Charged Skill will need CP (Charged Point)
    to use, you can get CP from Attack or CD Skill

    5.When the dot is red, it
    mean your attack in range, blue dot mean CD Skill in range and yellow dot is
    Charged Skill in range (some brawlers just have 1 or 2 dot color bacause of skill
    range)

    6.After 6 seconds don''t take any damage, no attack, no use skills,
    you will get heal 10%hp  per second

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8908fe7f99c80f4191255fa06d13b7c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6662692627902061172, guid: d8908fe7f99c80f4191255fa06d13b7c, type: 2}
